s increase was ''supported by the fund''s role in shaping the initiative,'' and the quote makes no mention of the fund''s involvement. Thus, the quote supports a key part of the claim but not the attribution, so a score of 0.75 is appropriate—partial support for the factual increase without the causal/attribution element.', '{}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
