aim about AI generative models and engagement algorithms playing a central role in disinformation production and amplification. However, the claim also includes a specific projection from the WEF Global Risks 2026 about deepfakes becoming ubiquitous, which is not addressed in the provided quote. The source is highly credible for the part it covers, but a careful analyst would note that the WEF projection is not substantiated by this quote alone. Therefore, the overall reliability for the full claim is very high but not perfect.', '{society}', NULL, 'continental', NULL, NULL);
