 quote does not mention France''s pledge to recycle 100% of plastics by 2025, so the source only partially supports the full claim. The article likely covers that detail elsewhere, but based on the given excerpt, the evidence is strong for the brand commitment but incomplete for the France pledge. Overall, a careful analyst would trust this source significantly but note the slight gap.', '{climate,ocean,biosphere,health,economy,society}', NULL, 'continental', NULL, NULL);
