, whole genome sequences). This is a direct, verbatim support for the claim, so the score is 1.0.', '{health,economy}', NULL, NULL, 'representative', 'Atlanta, Georgia, United States — The CDC''s Antimicrobial Resistance Laboratory Network, which conducted these tests, is headquartered in Atlanta, making it the canonical location for this US-focused effort.');
