 survey—none of which are supported by the quote or the source''s content as shown. For the part it does cover, careful analysts would still want to verify the original TBI report. Thus, the source is partially credible for a subset of the claim, warranting a moderate score.', '{society,economy}', NULL, 'national', 'measured', NULL);
