imSupport: The quote explicitly mentions that exceeding 2°C may trigger tipping points for both ice sheets, which aligns with the claim''s threshold range and tipping point concept. However, it does not detail the specific 1.6–2.7°C range, 7.4 m sea level rise, or irreversible collapse, so support is partial rather than full.', '{cryosphere,ocean,climate}', NULL, 'planetary', 'measured', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.factors OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE VALUES ('0e39fdcf-6138-495c-8614-eb53f3e010bd', 1, 'global', 'Warm-water coral reef tipping point crossed', 'Warm-water coral reefs are passing their thermal tipping point at current global warming of ~1.4°C, causing unprecedented dieback. Even if warming is stabilised at 1.5°C, reefs are virtually certain (>99% probability) to tip, meaning extensive reefs will be lost unless global temperature returns toward 1°C.', '[0.24511719,1.28125,0.96875,2.515625,2.421875,4.59375,-6.25,0.74609375,5.96875,1.8828125,2.09375,-2.5,2.3125,0.2578125,0.41796875,-0.65234375,6.75,4.71875,1.328125,-0.73046875,1.4296875,-0.30078125,-0.7421875,-1.9296875,0.16113281,8.75,3.796875,-5.40625,0.3046875,-1.3828125,1.59375,3.3125,0.64453125,4.90625,-2.5,0.07470703,0.25195312,-1.4453125,-1.953125,4.09375,2.125,-0.091308594,2.09375,-1.6484375,-1.296875,-0.57421875,-3.921875,-2.578125,1.25,0.71484375,1.59375,-2.640625,-2.453125,0.53125,3.5625,-0.18359375,0.96875,2.921875,0.25195312,-2.046875,-0.6640625,-3.859375,-3.53125,-0.7421875,-1.6015625,0.9140625,-3.46875,-2.171875,1.7578125,-1.46875,3.984375,-1.734375,1.9453125,-0.009460449,1.390625,-2.6875,-1.2734375,-5.9375,2.5625,0.12988281,0.6015625,-0.703125,-3.75,-0.58203125,1.0546875,-2.25,0.11279297,-0.37695312,-2.234375,0.56640625,0.9296875,1.34375,1.8671875,2.609375,1.4296875,-1.0234375,2.734375,-3.703125,1.0703125,-0.8515625,1.40625,2.046875,-0.5703125,-0.53515625,-1.6640625,3.375,1.96875,1.1953125,-1.8671875,0.515625,-1.3046875,-1.6328125,-0.056884766,-0.16894531,-1.71875,0.2734375,0.625,-2.28125,1.96875,1.71875,1.28125,-0.88671875,-1.0390625,0.18652344,2.59375,0.100097656,2.953125,1.1328125,1.3203125,3.71875,-1.4765625,-2.53125,-2.546875,-2.984375,-0.79296875,0.041259766,-0.8515625,1.5859375,-6.40625,1.7265625,0.078125,-0.31054688,-0.075683594,0.296875,-1.125,1.875,-5.40625,-0.18652344,-0.81640625,-2.703125,1.03125,1.140625,0.4453125,1.5625,-0.099609375,0.9609375,0.453125,1.9609375,0.515625,-2.